ith china  doesn't include china in it and oh by  the way you just expanded it five years  russia is thrilled china's thrilled this  is the problem that we have  you get into the paris climate agreement  yet you're not going to have  china turn around and have to follow the  same regulations as the united states  my concern is that the bible  administration is not taking china  seriously  this feels like it's going right back to  what it was where they just  assumed that china would be okay if we  tried to talk to them  china is there they want to be communist  china  they want to rule the world literally  and we need vision we need to be smart  about it we need to be strategic about  it and we need to understand  that they need to be held accountable  not one word yet  has been said about the fact that they  put this virus on the whole world no one  is asking china to be accountable for  that  it's time for us to step up it's not  about small things it's about  big issues and how we take on china  going forward  let me pivot and ask you about another  country iran how do we go  from killing an iranian general because  they were such an adversary to now being  willing to sit down at the table  and discuss their nuclear arsenal  how do you go from killing a general to  talking to them  trey this is truly dangerous i mean you  look at the fact that they're looking at  getting into  back into the iran deal what does that  mean that means you're going to lift  all of the sanctions that we've put on  iran well  the sanctions that we put on them weaken  them in terms of they weren't able to  fund terrorism  and weakened their economy so much that  they've got the iranian people  demonstrating in the streets  against the regime that's what we wanted  you're going to jump back in the iran  deal but you're not going to ask them to  leave syria  you're not going to ask them to stop  their nuclear program you're not going  to  ask them to stop their missile program  you're not going to ask them to stop  funding terrorism  and you're going to get back into a deal  and that's  literally obama 2.0 that's going right  back to the same situation and  this is a a bigger issue so now you're  going back to  you're actually hurting our friends  israel and the arab countries  that worked with us on getting these  sanctions back on iran that worked with  us  on trying to hold back terrorism and the  concern i have is  what you have is that by the  administration is snubbing our friends  like israel  but they're cozying up to enemies like  iran do you know biden's been  in office for two weeks now he has yet  to call the israeli prime minister one  of our  closest allies it i mean i just  i don't understand the logic whether  it's china whether it's iran  any of the foreign policy that he's  doing is really not being  about strong america it's about just  being complacent  with those that are our enemies  i want to ask you to put on your old  governor hat i'm going to play a clip  from another republican governor ron  desantis and then on the other side of  it i want to ask you two questions  so you had the new york post to run it  and you couldn't get any traction you  couldn't get any reach on it  because big tech put their thumb on the  scale so that was true what they said at  the time  oh it was it was it's a conspiracy or  it's based on  on on hacked information are you kidding  me  you're trying to tell me if there was  hacked information that could damage me  you guys wouldn't print it give me a  break you can whiz on my leg but don't  tell me it's raining you guys would  print it every single day if you could  and big tech would allow it to  proliferate every single day 20 set 24  7.  governor i watched you navigate a  primary  field full of men when you became the  governor i have watched you fight with  our south carolina general assembly when  they needed to be fought with  so i know you're tough how would you how  should republicans fight with both big  tech  and the media that you know ronnie is  right we perceive to be biased against  us  i mean we have to we have to speak about  the truth we've got to call them out and  say look  you know here everybody's talking about  unity right like that's the new buzzword  is everybody wants to talk about unity  but first you have to talk about you  know if you're going to talk about the  division  of republicans and democrats how are we  going to hold the media accountable how  are we going to hold big tech  accountable  they have to i'm not talking about  government coming in they have to  acknowledge  their responsibility in all of the  division  and it used to be a time where the left  was all about freedom of speech  now they want to reign that in you just  had aoc recently say that she wants a  commission  that will turn around and reign in any  of the right  wing news programs you have they are  literally they just had a call out they  want to cancel  fox news off of regular cable stations  fox news and other conservative outlets  they now want to take off of some of the  cable networks because they don't think  that it's safe to have on or they don't  think that it's right  what happened to the fact that the media  is supposed to give us the facts  not tell us what to think not tell us  how to think just give us the facts  give us both sides the american people  are smart enough to make those decisions  for ourselves we don't need the media  telling us and we don't need big tech  partnering with the media in terms of  what they think is the right speech and  the wrong speech  we are the greatest country in the world  at the u.n  i saw how envious all the countries were  about freedom of speech this literally  has every country in the world  scratching their head  saying what is happening in america it's  time for the media  to do their job it's time for big tech  to do their job  and i think every governor every  politician every  private citizen n